<title>AUSTRIA: VENEZUELA REITERATES IT STICKING TO OPEC QUOTA.</title>
<headline>VENEZUELA REITERATES IT STICKING TO OPEC QUOTA.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan oil minister Erwin Arrieta reiterated on Thursday that his country was holding to its OPEC-assigned output allocation.</p>
<p>&quot;We are producing to quota,&quot; he told reporters at the end of the OPEC conference.  </p>
<p>Venezuela has an OPEC quota of 2.359 million barrels per day (bpd) but is widely seen as producing around 800,000 bpd above that level.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
